          <td valign=top>
            <a name="DESC">
            Summer is upon us and I cannot possibly justify paying for all these accounts when I am not going to be playing, so it is liquidation time. Step right into the endgame and buy this level 65 double epic beastlord currently on the Bristlebane server (could easily be moved to Legends). This character has 89AAs and some nice gear. Check out his magelo: . …………………………………. http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=1014685 . . . ……………………………… He is a vah shir and has several pieces of ornate, his epics, and a few nice weapons too. Standard tier 2 flags is all (including tactics) – still need a few kills for Elementals.  He has several nice augs bringing his unbuffed hps to about 3600 but I am getting of tired of magelo and they only let you have three station names per magelo account so I am hand entering all this.  He has all the critical spells to 65 including the coveted 65 % slow.  Also included are several twinks from level 6 to mid 20s - not stripped but not noteworthy either.  The account has all expansions through LDoN enabled and it is active but has not been played since last fall. It is, of course, in good standing on BB. I will accept western union, USPS money order, or verified paypal (where the buyer’s e-mail matches their PA e-mail). Please do not bid on the account if you have less than 5 positive feedbacks on PA (prefer them to be a bit spread out). I reserve the right to discuss this transaction with you on the phone if you plan to use paypal and I suspect something is amiss. I am a highly ethical seller and I choose to do business with only ethical buyers. My feedback reflects this, so bid with confidence. This account is being sold with no minimum and no reserve; I am serious about getting rid of this stuff. Contact me with questions, but for starters he cannot be moved to another server besides legends, I don't have CD keys (nor do you need them), and I won't take trades or payments. Happy bidding and au revoir EQ.
